+/* Loka's look over Helium's components (@imput/helium-prism): the night sky, one hue per space, the system face.
+   Every color takes --hue, which the page sets to the space being shown (lib/spaces.ts skyHue).
+   Values follow the site's direction note (site/.critly/direction.md).
